52d061d": "海边|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "135bbf07": "海洋|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "39205212": "公园|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a1c3179f": "外公|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a4bebc5c": "游泳|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4aabadf8": "帮忙|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7ab0b288": "帮助|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c37de3d5": "点心|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e8f87778": "家务|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d109e70f": "生活|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ed322a76": "活动|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d1fffb4e": "快乐|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4a203946": "乐园|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5d26a969": "动物的物|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8bea580f": "家务的务|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "811292ad": "我们学校放假了，我和弟弟都高兴极了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "060c5f7c": "妈妈说，这个假期我们全家要去海边玩。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "26e65da8": "这是我们第一次去海边旅行，大家都很兴奋。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f4b69a84": "弟弟想在沙滩上堆城堡，我想在海边捡贝壳。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c120183a": "弟弟收拾东西的时候，我去帮忙，把游泳圈装进了包里。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ce4b23d0": "那个红色的小水桶是外公送给弟弟的礼物，他也带上了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1943e624": "出发以前，我们先做完了家务。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d9034b46": "我在书上看过，海洋里有好多好多动物。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "382fe503": "我最想看的海边动物是小螃蟹。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "946d95ac": "妈妈说，游泳的时候一定要有大人陪着。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2469acf4": "海边还有很多好玩的活动，比如放风筝、堆沙子。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "dacdd37c": "妈妈也给我们带了很多好吃的点心。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "30b6820e": "弟弟说，这一定是他最快乐的一个假期。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cca0e65e": "奶奶，我们回家以后，就去看您。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2a66bd02": "我们可以给您带一些漂亮的贝壳吗？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5dc905a5": "学校放假了！明天我们去海边旅行，今天先收拾东西吧。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "01558715": "我想在沙滩上堆一座大城堡！|zh-CN-YunxiaNeural|-10%", "d198afc2": "我帮你把游泳圈装进包里，还有外公送的小水桶。|zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural|-10%", "9b7951e5": "出发以前，我们先把家务活儿做完，好吗？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3f2e1c5e": "我扫地，姐姐擦桌子，一点儿也不难！|zh-CN-YunxiaNeural|-10%", "beaf56e2": "书上说海洋里有好多动物，海边能看到小螃蟹吗？|zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural|-10%", "403a0651": "能！不过下水游泳的时候，一定要有大人陪着。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5cfef1c9": "太好了！这一定是最快乐的假期！|zh-CN-YunxiaNeural|-10%", "72cf70a1": "暑假|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e42e71d7": "以前|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "39ea35f2": "旅馆|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7d316795": "动物园|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d859cf26": "海水|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b3e9ff38": "洋娃娃|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7d77521e": "公鸡|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "046928b3": "泳衣|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "dc65bcce": "帮手|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cc793900": "点头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0aad2c7b": "服务|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "750ee46a": "干活|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8334d7a2": "快点儿|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b7b9e0ca": "可乐|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "417a5327": "Bingo!|en-US-AvaNeural|-12%"}